#: 17cbd045afcb46588af7274ef101a08e
msgid "Performance benchmarking"
msgstr "性能基准测试"

#: 459d5f045c0a40cea7ac7dae07dd5f0e
msgid ""
"Jittor uses ASV 0.6.6 to retain commit-indexed timing and memory results. "
"The suite deliberately uses the current Python environment "
"(`--python=same`): a fresh environment per historical commit would mostly "
"measure Jittor's compile and installation cost rather than steady-state "
"runtime performance."
msgstr ""

#: 301f43f82aa64e538eedf97794efee86
msgid "Cache isolation"
msgstr ""

#: dde0ab5bcbfd476a886c1e6831b3d10a
msgid ""
"ASV and the unit-test suite must never compile into the same Jittor cache. "
"Every benchmark setup validates both variables before importing Jittor:"
msgstr ""

#: 87b0379ea7654d55bb8d7698268786a1
msgid ""
"`cache_name` must begin with `asv-`, and the resolved `JITTOR_HOME` must "
"contain an `asv` path component. A missing or reused cache is a hard error, "
"not an ASV skip. Give parallel CPU, CUDA, and NPU jobs different "
"`JITTOR_HOME` directories or different `cache_name` values."
msgstr ""

#: d81e6a71cfd7421e9b16592eaefec1e6
msgid ""
"ASV removes ordinary `PYTHONPATH` when it starts an existing environment."
" `ASV_PYTHONPATH` is therefore the explicit source-tree path passed to "
"benchmark processes; the nox sessions set it to `python/` automatically. "
"The sessions also put the Jittor compile cache and generated ASV state "
"outside the checkout. `ASV_RESULTS_DIR` and `ASV_HTML_DIR` may select "
"durable external locations for raw JSON and the published report."
msgstr ""
"ASV 启动现有环境时会移除普通的 `PYTHONPATH`。因此，`ASV_PYTHONPATH` 是传递给基准进程的显式"
"源码树路径；nox 会话会自动将其设为 `python/`。这些会话还会把 Jittor 编译缓存和生成的 ASV "
"状态放在检出目录之外。可以通过 `ASV_RESULTS_DIR` 和 `ASV_HTML_DIR` 为原始 JSON 和发布后的报告"
"指定可持久保存的外部位置。"

#: 4fc157e0ab884bc1abd60634a2543241
msgid "Canonical nox runs"
msgstr "规范的 nox 运行方式"

#: 0b8315a393e2bf457da9eec868662d03bd
msgid ""
"Install the pinned development tools and record the maintained CPU "
"selection:"
msgstr "安装固定版本的开发工具，并记录维护中的 CPU 基准集合："

#: fd5c384a92874f73bfb2895e3fbf6fa6
msgid ""
"On a labeled CUDA host with the pinned CUDA benchmark dependencies "
"installed, record the accelerator selection with:"
msgstr "在已安装固定版本 CUDA 基准依赖的带标签 CUDA 宿主上，使用以下命令记录加速器基准集合："

#: df87f493dec64307b44577dff1ea2f63
msgid ""
"Both sessions perform a real ASV pipeline: `check`, register the machine,"
" `run` the exact current commit with samples, `compare` it with the "
"nearest cached ancestor (or an explicit `ASV_COMPARE_BASE`), then "
"`publish` the HTML report. `ASV_COMPARE_FACTOR` controls the regression "
"factor and must be greater than one. A first run bootstraps comparison "
"against itself. A run is successful only when result JSON and "
"`index.html` both exist."
msgstr ""
"两个会话都会执行真实的 ASV 流程：先运行 `check`，注册机器，再通过 `run` 记录当前提交及样本，"
"通过 `compare` 与缓存中最近的祖先提交（或显式指定的 `ASV_COMPARE_BASE`）比较，最后使用 "
"`publish` 发布 HTML 报告。`ASV_COMPARE_FACTOR` 控制回归判定倍数，且必须大于 1。首次运行会以"
"当前提交自身初始化比较。只有结果 JSON 和 `index.html` 同时存在时，本次运行才算成功。"

#: 1d6b02228b074a908c733e37b2c53f78
msgid ""
"The result label must match the checkout. The nox sessions reject a dirty"
" tree unless the caller deliberately sets `ASV_ALLOW_DIRTY=1`, which is "
"intended only for local investigation and not publishable evidence."
msgstr ""
"结果标签必须与检出版本一致。除非调用方明确设置 `ASV_ALLOW_DIRTY=1`，否则 nox 会话会拒绝脏工作树；"
"该选项仅用于本地调查，不能作为可发布的验证证据。"

#: eefc5d673714433bb6ba25b4c80abf46
msgid ""
"The CPU parameters import and execute without CUDA. CUDA parameters raise an"
" explicit ASV skip when Jittor or real PyTorch cannot execute on CUDA. Real "
"PyTorch is an optional oracle and must be installed separately for the "
"target platform; an absent or shim-resolved `torch` is reported as skipped, "
"never as a zero-duration result. At least one mandatory Jittor CPU case must"
" execute in CI, so a run in which every parameter skips is not acceptable."
msgstr ""

#: 99bd9fd90706401a9e5272a184142e8b
msgid "Record selected revisions"
msgstr ""

#: 21b029731c154dff9f6b97e168760ffd
msgid ""
"Existing environments cannot ask ASV to build an arbitrary history. Run the "
"suite only from a checkout that matches the result label, and record that "
"exact commit:"
msgstr ""

#: 0ebebf90a6034c38bdf6e989bb278865
msgid ""
"For a comparison, create one dedicated benchmark worktree, switch that "
"worktree only to the two or three reviewed revisions, and run the command "
"above after each switch. Keep the same compiler, accelerator, dependency "
"versions, cache warmup policy, and ASV results directory. Do not run `ALL` "
"or an unbounded revision range. Use `asv compare <base> <candidate>` after "
"both selected commits have results."
msgstr ""

#: f3f0ef92c405437c8a9bf463b340adfd
msgid "CI retention and cadence"
msgstr "CI 结果留存与执行频率"

#: 33f2af62b1e74bcfa5b367d1bd96b594
msgid ""
"The CPU workflow runs `nox -s benchmark` in the baseline CPU container. "
"It restores prior result JSON when available, records the current commit,"
" compares and publishes, then saves the updated result cache. Raw JSON "
"and generated HTML are uploaded together as a retained CI artifact."
msgstr ""
"CPU 工作流在基线 CPU 容器中运行 `nox -s benchmark`。如果存在历史结果 JSON，工作流会先恢复它，"
"再记录当前提交、执行比较和发布，随后保存更新后的结果缓存。原始 JSON 与生成的 HTML 会一起上传为保留的 "
"CI 产物。"

#: fd57b3b6d7bb45f0822890216bd69ef4
msgid ""
"The CUDA benchmark is intentionally not a pull-request gate. The CUDA "
"workflow runs `nox -s benchmark_cuda` after its real-device test gate on "
"the weekly schedule and on manual dispatch. It uses the labeled CUDA 12.2"
" RTX 4090 runner, keeps a separate result cache, and uploads a separate "
"CUDA JSON/HTML artifact. This cadence makes accelerator regressions "
"visible without consuming dedicated hardware for every source push."
msgstr ""
"CUDA 基准有意不作为拉取请求门禁。CUDA 工作流会在每周定时任务和手动触发时，于真实设备测试门禁通过后"
"运行 `nox -s benchmark_cuda`。它使用带标签的 CUDA 12.2 RTX 4090 runner，维护独立的结果"
"缓存，并上传独立的 CUDA JSON/HTML 产物。这样的执行频率既能暴露加速器回归，也无需为每次源码推送"
"占用专用硬件。"

